[h1][b]Greetings, Princesses & Bovines! 🐮👑[/b][/h1]

Get rid of those tight dresses and polish your hammers, ‘cause we will be having our first-ever open tournament on [b]December 17th, 9 PM PST[/b]!

[h2][b]📜 Rules[/b][/h2]
[list]
[*] The tournament will consist of 16 - 64 players, for you to join the tournament you must claim a beta key (ask for @lady_turkiz’s and/or @bernardo’s assistance on the #get-a-steam-key channel over our [b][url=https://discord.gg/FMYBRCaPnE]Discord server[/url][/b]) and fill out [b][url=https://forms.gle/oR3gecE2Rt4oS6Jm9]this form[/url][/b];
[*] Tournament stages: Round 1, Round 2, semi-finals, and finals;
[*] Round 1 & 2 will be on Standard Mode, best of 1 game;
[*] Elimination will be also on Standard Mode, best of 3 games;
[*] Semi-finals will be on Turbo Mode, best of 3 games;
[*] Finals will be on Ultimate Mode, best of 5 games.
[/list]
[h2][b]✨ Prizes[/b][/h2]
[list]
[*] 1st place: $30 Steam gift card + 3000 Discord bot XP;
[*] 2nd place: $20 Steam gift card  + 2000 Discord bot XP;
[*] 3rd place: $10 Steam gift card + 1000 Discord bot XP;
[*] Every other place will receive 400 - 800 XP on Discord depending on placement.
[/list]
Additionally, the top 8 will be able to pick one of these games, in order of victory:
[list]
[*] Aero;
[*] Bleed 2;
[*] Darkside Detective;
[*] Full Metal Furies;
[*] Just Cause 3 XXL Edition;
[*] Project CARS 2;
[*] Rapture Rejects;
[*] Rock of Ages 2: Bigger and Boulder;
[*] Sniper Elite 3;
[*] Super Daryl Deluxe;
[*] Yakuza 0.
[/list]
[h2][b]❤️ Join Our Discord Realm[/b][/h2]

Make sure to join our [b][url=https://discord.gg/FMYBRCaPnE]Discord server[/url][/b],  turn on the notifications on our Tournament Channels, and get the Announcements role over #role-assignment!


See you in Akrotheria!
